\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Decoder-only Transformer language model}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{transformer}
\tag{language-model}

\p{A \newvocab{decoder-only Transformer language model} maps a token prefix
to a next-token law by the following composition. It forms an initial
hidden-state sequence from token and position representations, applies a
finite stack of decoder blocks, and applies the language-model output head to
the final position.}

\p{Section 6 of \citef{phuong2022formal} gives the decoder-only architecture
and its prediction algorithm. Its parameters
#{\theta} include the learned representations, block parameters, normalization
parameters, and output head. The tokenizer is part of the model artifact but
is not a differentiable layer of this composition.}
